You sense the presence of spoilers.--More--

ok.  Wield the weapon in question.
get confused.  (not Stunned, confused.)
read a blessed or uncursed scroll of enchant weapon.
The weapon will the be rust-proof.

Note that some weapons, such as those made of wood, are naturally
rust-proof and don't need such treatment.  They are vulnerable to
other forms of degradation, however.

>How do you level teleport?  (I think it is use a scroll of T while
>confused and wearing a ring of T control) This right?

That will work.  The ring is not specifically necessary for level
teleporting; you only need it if you want to control your destination.
You might also use a cursed scroll or a level-teleport trap.  You also
might eat a tengu corpse and get intrinsic teleport control without
the ring.

